SUMMARY:Civic Meetup #567: Insights from the Tracking (In)justice Project -
  by Civic Tech Toronto
LOCATION:In person or online (Address available to attendees)
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://guild.host/events/civic-meetup-567-insights-nikefd\n\nHosted by
  Civic Tech Toronto (https://civictech.ca/)\n\nLast year\, 61 people died
  in interactions with the police or in incarceration facilities across the
  country. With a team of researchers spanning Carleton\, McGill\, Queens\,
  UofT\, and UBC\,  the Tracking (In)Justice project aims at systematically
  and transparently cataloguing the circumstances around these deaths.
END:VEVENT
