DESCRIPTION:More info: https://soulpepper.ca/repercussions-live/\n\nHosted
  by Soulpepper (https://www.soulpepper.ca/)\n\nOn the night of the
  American midterms and in the shadow of Toronto’s municipal election the
  week prior\, hosts Elamin Abdelmahmoud (CBC Commotion) and Joan Summers
