  gathering to discuss short\, selected readings that explore the basics of
  intentional community living. This week chapter\, What Is an Intentional
  Community? [p25-34]\, defines intentional communities\, distinguishes
  them from other housing arrangements\, and surveys different models such
  as cohousing\, ecovillages\, housing cooperatives\, communes\, and shared
  households.
END:VEVENT
